      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但为了“让所有赛马娘幸福”的梦想，\n鲁道夫象征放弃了“特别”跟\n凶猛无情的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56a3ca4dba37cd763be912429466c7b8dc71971b2ee435c12519a75515dd4681",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
