      "uid": "zhcn:b5d2ce513d79518b45a51755",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征过去的目标是\n宛如野兽般的鲁道夫象征，\n但她说现在不是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cd11f89411acb68a81c723235c14347b7bf401ce92cfa153e8f375df3271d08",
